{"post_stream":{"posts":[{"id":484548,"name":"Nicolas Rodrigues","username":"Nicolas_Rodrigues","avatar_template":"/user_avatar/forum.cursor.com/nicolas_rodrigues/{size}/120050_2.png","created_at":"2026-09-06T12:52:51.730Z","cooked":"\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-484548-where-does-the-bug-appear-featureproduct-1\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-484548-where-does-the-bug-appear-featureproduct-1\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eWhere does the bug appear (feature/product)?\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eGrok Bot\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-484548-describe-the-bug-2\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-484548-describe-the-bug-2\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eDescribe the Bug\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eI’m trying to go back to using my Grok Bot account. I opened it today and the latest messages were from 2:21 AM GMT-3. It hangs on “Setting up…” or Trying to reconnect. Both on MacOS (latest stable release, M5 Max) and on my iPhone 16 Max. I tried to logout and login again but then it just says gives me an error screen saying “Can’t Reach Grok Bot’s Computer”. Now and then it goes after that screen but just shows me an empty UI and a message saying “Reconnecting to your computer”. Now and then it goes after that screen but just shows me an empty UI and a message saying “Reconnecting to your computer”\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eUpdate: Tried to enter from different machines/networks/everything and nothing fixed it. The only thing i can think of is that this is an issue from grok bot’s side and not mine.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-484548-steps-to-reproduce-3\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-484548-steps-to-reproduce-3\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eSteps to Reproduce\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003col\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eLogin into my account\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eIt crashes\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ol\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-484548-expected-behavior-4\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-484548-expected-behavior-4\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eExpected Behavior\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eBe able to login and work\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-484548-screenshots-screen-recordings-5\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-484548-screenshots-screen-recordings-5\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eScreenshots / Screen Recordings\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"\u003e\u003ca class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://us1.discourse-cdn.com/cursor1/original/3X/7/e/7e5831fd8294da1d9de7be5aa28a84417999e03a.png\" data-download-href=\"/uploads/short-url/i1H7mAMfZooIx6V3y0gsyPbb5Me.png?dl=1\" title=\"Untitled.png\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https://us1.discourse-cdn.com/cursor1/optimized/3X/7/e/7e5831fd8294da1d9de7be5aa28a84417999e03a_2_487x500.png\" alt=\"Untitled.png\" data-base62-sha1=\"i1H7mAMfZooIx6V3y0gsyPbb5Me\" width=\"487\" height=\"500\" srcset=\"https://us1.discourse-cdn.com/cursor1/optimized/3X/7/e/7e5831fd8294da1d9de7be5aa28a84417999e03a_2_487x500.png, https://us1.discourse-cdn.com/cursor1/original/3X/7/e/7e5831fd8294da1d9de7be5aa28a84417999e03a.png 1.5x, https://us1.discourse-cdn.com/cursor1/original/3X/7/e/7e5831fd8294da1d9de7be5aa28a84417999e03a.png 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"141414\"\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"meta\"\u003e\u003csvg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"\u003e\u003cuse href=\"#far-image\"\u003e\u003c/use\u003e\u003c/svg\u003e\u003cspan class=\"filename\"\u003eUntitled.png\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"informations\"\u003e509×522 19.8 KB\u003c/span\u003e\u003csvg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"\u003e\u003cuse href=\"#discourse-expand\"\u003e\u003c/use\u003e\u003c/svg\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-484548-operating-system-6\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-484548-operating-system-6\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003